---
# The tree's .clang-tidy with one check removed for tests/ only.
#
# bugprone-unchecked-optional-access does not model GoogleTest's assertion macros,
# so dereferences guarded by ASSERT_TRUE(x.has_value()) produce false positives.
# Production source and tools keep the check.
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: '-bugprone-unchecked-optional-access'
